==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~8 seconds<sup>60f~240f</sup>.
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 13.33~40 seconds<sup>400f~1,200f</sup>.
*8 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**200 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**4 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Treat this stage as you would treat [[Moon (Empire of Cats)#Chapter 3 2|Chapter 3 Moon]], but a more buffed version of it. Any strategies that worked for Chapter 3 Moon will also work here.

